  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A ungermaw must eat twice the normal amount for his race to avoid starvation. Any effects that suppress the ungermaw’s need to eat fail to function. The ungermaw could eat an entire heroes feast and still be hungry.</p>\n<p><sup>* This stands for “penalty”. See <em>Alternate Paths: Martial Characters</em> for more information on penalties.</sup></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ungermaw#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
